    "evidence_for_objective_imbalance": [
      "At the final fixed-period checkpoint, the weighted spectral parameter gradient is 1074.6 times the weighted variance gradient.",
      "At the final adaptive checkpoint, the same ratio is 55.6.",
      "Multiplying the fixed-period stream by 128 raises mean std only to about 0.288 yet slightly lowers total loss; the sampled objective optimum is not at the stated std>=1 margin.",
